    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109415" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποτρομ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποτρέμω</span>
			, <i>tremble under,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρομέει δ᾽ ὑπὸ γυῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.95
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>tremble before</i> any one, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μιν . . ὑποτρομέεσκον ὁρῶντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.28
				</span></i>
			: withoutacc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποτρομέουσιν ἅπαντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					22.241
				</span></i>
			.</div>
